[en.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE]
Limestone Pie’s Revenge

[en.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE_desc]
The Empire has made me lose my dearest sister, my dearest friend, and my dearest parents. And All the ponies on the rock farm have lost so much in these ten Year. I will make the Empire pay the worst price to feel our angry.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE]
石青派的复仇

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE_desc]
帝国害我失去了我最亲爱的妹妹，我最亲爱的朋友，还有我最亲爱的父母，整个采石农场的小马都在新元年失去了太多，我要让帝国付出最惨痛的代价来感受愤怒

